  "brief": {"zh": "地址 0、1 是机器人的东、北坐标，2、3 是每拍向东、北的位移，4、5 是转台中心东、北坐标。机器人再走两拍。转台用中心作原点，以北为新 X、以西为新 Y。将两拍后的新坐标写入 0、1，新方向下的每拍位移写入 2、3。保留中心，把新 X+新 Y 写入 6 和 ACC。", "en": "Addresses 0 and 1 hold the robot’s east and north coordinates, 2 and 3 are its east and north displacement per tick, and 4 and 5 are the turntable centre. Move forward two ticks. Use the centre as the new origin, with north as X and west as Y. Store the new position in 0 and 1 and the displacement in the new axes in 2 and 3. Keep the centre and write new X + new Y to 6 and ACC."},
